# Line endings.
# Text files are stored and checked out with plain \n on every machine, so files written by
# the tool (CSV writer rules: \n line endings) match byte for byte everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Raw data is immutable (FR-001) and fingerprinted in snapshot.json / MANIFEST.sha256,
# so git must store and check it out exactly as written, with no line-ending conversion.
data/raw/** -text

# Binary files
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pdf binary
*.onnx binary
